repository-code: "https://github.com/ARAVINDPM/pointcloud-snow-filter-ros2-portfolio"
abstract: >
  Research prototype for comparing classical and adaptive point-cloud outlier
  filters on snow-contaminated LiDAR scans. This clean export includes code,
  synthetic data generation, metrics, and tests. Raw thesis sensor data is not
  redistributed.
keywords:
  - "point clouds"
  - "LiDAR"
  - "outlier removal"
  - "snow filtering"
  - "autonomous perception"
  - "3D filtering"
